/.venv-*
# `.github/scripts/install_cell.sh` is documented as runnable locally
# (docs/benchmarks/README.md): it creates `venv-<library>/` in the checkout root
# (no leading dot, so `/.venv-*` above does not cover it -- and the EXIT trap
# that removes it does not fire on a SIGKILL), writes its per-cell records and
# pip logs into `install-cells/`, and `assemble_matrix.py` writes the merged
# matrix. None of that is source; without these a later `git add -A` sweeps in
# four JSON records, four logs and possibly a few hundred MB of venv.
/venv-*
/install-cells/
/docs/benchmarks/install-matrix.json
